              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "The app as it ships on main (18 Oct 2026, with flow Q · Assign an expense to an Envelope, flow R · Long-press and Move expenses here…, flow S · Paying ahead into a later cycle's envelope, flow T · Envelope detail, flow U · Paid early moves money between plans, flow V · Tagged rows — the tag gets its own line, flow W · Set aside for a later envelope, flow X · Bank logos for Accounts, flow Y · Bank logo legibility — the row's mark at 22pt, flow Z · The bank leads the expense row, and flow AA · Banks in the Plan lens). Every flow on this page exists in the app; unbuilt proposals and rejected options live on 05 · Proposals. Every screen is composed from the Design System components — fix a component there and every screen follows. Rows read left → right in the order the owner moves through them. Seed data = DebugLaunch -seedSampleData (August 2026, payday 31) and -seedPlanData normal|payday|auto-landed|overspent|travelling|paid-early (the September 2026 plan; travelling adds flow Q's sample, paid-early adds flow S's next-cycle plan, Travelling on BCA, and the ticket).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font/family",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
