                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1200,
                  "content": "Resolves a contradiction in PRD §8, which gives Category an optional Group while also listing Manage as unchanged. Group is user data, so it gets the same treatment as Category, Person and Account: its own Manage section with add, rename, swipe-delete, an empty state and the existing duplicate-name prompt (§9.6). A Category belongs to zero or one Group, chosen from the Category editor. Only the Group % table reads it.",
