                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "PRD §7.6. A PlanItem with an Account gains a middle state between Todo and Done — Funded (◐): the money is in that account, the bill is not paid yet. Per item; the transfer line's Sent tick stays independent. Fixed manual, Fixed Auto and Envelope all take part (an Envelope gains an optional Account and joins that transfer line). Done may skip Funded; un-ticking Done lands back on Funded. Every change goes through a Menu. Carry-over starts every item at Todo. Only one notice shows at a time: review › carried-over › funded › payday.",
