                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "An item with no Account has nowhere to be \"in\", so it keeps today's two states: ◯ opens this E4 sheet directly, no menu. Likewise an Auto item or an Envelope with no Account keeps an inert bolt / tray. Picking an Account in the item editor is what unlocks ◐.",
