                      "content": "One section per Account, largest planned total first — the same order as the transfer checklist at the foot (BNI 7,7 jt · CC Danamon 4,8 jt · BCA 3,9 jt · Mandiri 2,4 jt · Jago · Cash). Unassigned is always last. Inside a group, items run by due day in cycle (payday 25: 28 before 1), then undated by amount. Rows are unchanged — the Account chip stays. Dormant stays one folded section, unsorted.",
