                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "One section per Group, in the share table's order (largest planned total first), tinted with the Group's colour. An Envelope lands in the Group most of its categories share — the rule GroupShares already uses — so the list and the share table never disagree. Ungrouped (here: Transport has no Group) is always last. Inside: due day in cycle, then undated by amount.",
