                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Flat — one card, no header per date; the Due badge on each row already says the day. Ordered by where the day falls in the cycle, not by its number: payday 25, so Due 25 and Due 28 come before Due 1. Items with no due day (every Envelope, and any day the cycle cannot reach) follow, largest amount first.",
