                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Every breakdown row is a Button with a chevron (K1). The chip reads Pay period; under it, the Pay period row is a Menu of cycles (O2) and replaces the Payday stepper, which lives on only in Expenses → Monthly Start Date. The new SPENDING card is the window's whole total with Flow N's split bar and chips; it shows the chips only when the window has From-plan spending. Spend over Time marks the selected cycle in amber.",
