                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Picked July from the menu, then lit Outside plan. July is a past cycle, so the window is the whole cycle (30/06 ~ 30/07). SPENDING stays whole (4.515.000); every chart below follows the half: the plan's Kos, Cicilan and Internet are gone, so the week's Makan, Kopi and Transport finally read. Spend over Time shows each cycle's Outside-plan spending, July in amber; June had none. The pill floats above the tab bar. Picking another cycle or chip resets the filter to All.",
