                      "content": "Category = not Kopi, Makan and Account = Cash. Cash paid only for the Morning coffee and the Lunch, both hidden, so nothing is left. The message and Clear Filters are §4.6's, unchanged: hiding is part of the filter, not a case of its own. Clear Filters also clears the plan filter (§4.8). The pill joins the two rows with “ · ”; the Category row starts with “not”. Badge 2.",
