                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Travelling claims no Category; its bar is fed by assigned expenses alone (Rp 685.000 of Rp 2.000.000). Hidup stays at Rp 226.900 left: the Makan and Bensin assigned to Travelling are skipped. Every active envelope gains a ＋ beside its bar, outside the row's tap target: “Add expense to Travelling” opens Add Expense already assigned, dated now (or the viewed cycle's last/first day). Tapping the row edited the item until flow T; it now opens the envelope's detail (T2), and the editor is behind its Edit. Since flow R the ＋ is a menu: New expense (this) or Move expenses here… (R4).",
