                      "content": "Lists the cycle's expenses that are not in Travelling yet, newest day first, each with its current tag so the owner sees what it would leave. Rows a Fixed item created are not listed. The title carries what is left; the button counts the ticks and applies them at once. Picking a target first means no envelope picker is needed afterwards.",
