                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "§4.10.2. The ticket is dated 14 Oct, so its own cycle is October. October's envelopes stay under ENVELOPES; every later cycle that has a plan and has not ended follows, one section each, headed “‹CYCLE TITLE› · PAID EARLY”, its active envelopes by planned amount ↓. November's remainders count expenses already paid early into them. Transport is claimed by no envelope, so By category reads “Outside plan”. No plan is created to fill this list.",
                      "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
