                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "§4.10.3. Paid early into a later cycle's envelope, the row reads the envelope's name in primary text and “· ‹Mon›” in secondary — the month of that cycle's title. The name truncates, never the suffix. Moving the date into November keeps the assignment (then it reads plain “Travelling”); moving it past 24 Nov resets it to By category before Save (§4.10.4).",
