                      "content": "§4.10.1, §4.10.6. November's plan exists because the owner paged the Plan lens forward. Travelling counts the ticket dated 14 Oct: Rp 1.200.000 of Rp 2.000.000, Rp 800.000 left — and the drift strip would count an overspend. A caption under the legend says where it came from: “Rp 1.200.000 paid early in October” (the month only when every such expense comes from one cycle). November's List lens never lists the ticket. Hidup and Kebutuhan Kos have nothing yet. Since flow W (set-aside.md §4.6) the row reads \"→ Rp 1.200.000 from October\" — one line for everything from earlier cycles — and \"Rp 800.000 from November\" under the planned amount.",
                      "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
