                      "content": "§4.3, §4.4. Hidup claims Makan, Bensin and E-money, so its card names them. Listed is exactly what EnvelopeClaims puts in Hidup: the three seed expenses, Rp 711.400 — the bar's spent figure to the rupiah. Nasi Padang Bandung (Makan) and Bensin ke Bandung (Bensin) are not here: they are assigned to Travelling (T2). Kado ultah Tarisa (Makan, No envelope) is not here either.",
