                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "§4.11. Every tag kind sits on its own line above the Category: dashed Travelling · Nov (paid early), outlined envelopes, the filled Plan tag (Fixed). The note gets the whole text column back, so “Tiket KAI ke Jakarta · BCA” is one line. Kopi, logged by hand, has no tag and looks exactly as today. Long envelope names now run to the text column before they truncate.",
