                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "The check circle narrows the text column. Beside Rp 1.200.000 even “Travelling · Nov” does not fit: the name gives way (“Travelli…”), “· Nov” never does — as on the simulator. Long envelope names lose a few more letters. The note has no width floor any more: nothing sits beside it. The Fixed row stays at 40% with its circle's space kept (#23), its tag dimmed with it.",
