                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/set-aside.md, ADR-0010. Built 17 Oct 2026, schema V5. A third PlanItem kind: an earlier plan sets money aside for an envelope of a later plan — October and November put 5jt and 7jt towards December's Rp 20.000.000 Jepang. It is in its own plan's Total cost, credits the later plan's Sisa uncapped (\"Set aside in October\" / \"Set aside earlier\"), joins its Account's transfer line, ticks ◯ → ✓ through a one-item menu without creating an expense, and is never copied forward. The later envelope's row says what reached it from earlier cycles (\"→ Rp 18.500.000 from earlier\", paid early and set aside together — replacing flow S's caption everywhere) and what its own cycle still puts in (\"Rp 1.500.000 from December\"). Sample: PRD §7 — payday 25, Gaji 18jt, Kos 2,2jt (BCA), Hidup 3jt, Jepang 20jt (Jago), a Rp 6.500.000 ticket paid early on 2 Oct. On device: -seedPlanData set-aside.",
