                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "§4.5, §4.6. Total cost stays Σ planned (25,2jt). The ticket comes back as Paid early in October (+6,5jt) and fills Jepang's bar as spent; the two set-aside lines come back as \"Set aside earlier\" (+12jt). Sisa = 18jt − 25,2jt + 6,5jt + 12jt = 11,3jt. Jepang's row: one line for the money from earlier cycles, \"→ Rp 18.500.000 from earlier\", and under its planned amount what December still puts in, \"Rp 1.500.000 from December\" — the same figure it adds to ke Jago (W6). No cap: setting aside 25jt would credit 25jt and read \"Rp 0 from December\".",
