                      "content": "§4.9. After W7, October's line stays: still in Total cost (10,2jt), crediting no one. The ticket's assignment was nullified too, so it counts by category again and the Paid early row is gone — Sisa 18jt − 10,2jt = 7,8jt. The title reads \"No envelope\", the second line \"Pick an envelope\" in the warning colour; a tap opens the editor with For empty. The same face shows when a payday change re-cuts the target into this cycle or an earlier one.",
