                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "§5.3. The developer deleted the mandiri record in CloudKit Console. After the next fetch, Mandiri Tabungan draws building.columns in its own tint — its colour is Automatic, so the tint now comes from the name, as for any Account. brandID is kept: adding a record with id “mandiri” back restores the logo on every device.",
