                      "content": "§5.5, the owner's pick (B; C was recommended). The meta line is note · people; the Account sits under the amount with its 14pt mark — a logo, the bank glyph, or its own symbol — and its name in caption grey, capped so a long name truncates before the note does. Unassigned rows have no second line. VoiceOver reads it after the amount.",
