                      "content": "Expense card, option B (owner's pick; C was recommended). Search keeps its date under the amount, so the trailing column is amount, account, date — owner override, against moving the date into the meta line. A row with no Account (Kopi Tuku) skips the account line. A2-era sample, renamed.",
