                  "fill": "$color/text",
                  "content": "Y · Bank logo legibility — the row's mark at 22pt",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pPrf9",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/bank-logos.md §5.1, §5.5, decision 22. Built 17 Oct 2026, the evening flow X shipped. On the owner's iPhone 12 the Account's logo under the amount was unreadable: every catalog logo is a wide wordmark centred in a square image, and the 14pt circle with 19% padding drew its letters ~2.6pt tall. ExpenseAccountLabel now draws AccountIcon at 22pt (ScaledMetric, caption) and passes BankLogoMark a thin 8% inset; every other mark keeps 19%. Symbols for Accounts without a logo grow with it. A row whose meta line is one line grows from 58 to 65pt. Owner's pick: A, against the recommended wordmark chip (B); B, C and D stay on 05. Real logo art from design/images/bank-logos.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
