              "id": "fJArN",
              "name": "Sub",
              "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 2200,
              "content": "Owner, 18 Oct: the expense list is getting option Z·A (logo leads the row); now show the banks in the Plan lens too — the plan items and, asked mid-draw, the payday Transfer checklist (E3). Today a plan chip, the sorted-by-Account header and the checklist draw every bank as the same building.columns glyph or plain text (bank-logos PRD §5.2, decision 7). Each column shows its Plan section and, below, its Transfer checklist. Same plan everywhere, October cycle, sorted by Amount unless the option says otherwise: 10 items, Rp 20.630.300 over seven Accounts — BNI, CC Danamon, BCA (where Gaji lands), Mandiri, Jago, Superbank (6:1 wordmark, the hardest case) and Cash (no logo, keeps its banknote symbol); 3 of 6 transfers sent. Logos are the catalog art cropped to the wordmark (design/images/bank-logos/trim).",
              "fontFamily": "$font/family",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
