                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Draws the money's route. The income card says where each income lands (\"Gaji into BCA\"); every Transfer checklist line becomes BCA → BNI with both wordmark plates, and a footer says what stays in BCA for its own items. The plan rows stay as shipped. Makes it obvious which app to open on payday (BCA's) and where each transfer goes. Cost: needs a new field — the Account an income line lands in (schema change + editor row); when all income lands in one Account the BCA plate repeats on every line, which is noise (a single \"from BCA\" header would say it once). Pattern: Wise / Flip transfer receipts, mobile-banking transfer lists.",
