                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The Transfer checklist leaves the foot of the Plan lens and becomes a \"Payday · by bank\" card at the top: a split bar of the Rp 20.630.300 by Account (brand tints), then one line per Account with its check, wordmark plate, a tint dot that ties it to the bar, and what it needs — including \"stays in BCA\" for the Account Gaji lands in. The plan follows with rows as shipped. Payday becomes: open Plan, work down the bank card, done — no scrolling past the plan. Cost: the plan items start ~520pt lower, so day-to-day use (ticking a bill) scrolls further; the bar's tints only work if the brand tints stay distinct. Pattern: Monarch's cash-flow split, Jago's \"Atur Uang\" pocket funding.",
