                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Today's row with the same data, for comparison. The bank is there but secondary: a 22pt circle under the amount beside the Account name. The category owns the row's leading icon and title, so a glance down the list reads categories, not banks.",
