                      "id": "srJDQ",
                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Rows stay as they ship. Above the first day, a horizontal rail of Account tiles shows where this cycle's money went: wordmark chip, Account name, the cycle's spend from it, sorted by spend; it scrolls sideways when there are more. Tapping a tile filters the list to that Account — the same Account filter as flow P, so its pill appears and Reset clears it. The bank becomes a navigation tool rather than decoration; rows themselves stay compact. Combines with A or C if the rows should carry the bank more strongly too. Pattern: Revolut / Jenius account cards over the activity feed.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
