                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The inverse of A. The category keeps its 40pt circle and the bank logo sits on its lower-right corner as a 24pt white circle, ringed in the card colour (wordmark ~18pt wide). The Account name stays under the amount. Keeps today's category-first reading while the bank is always attached to the icon. Reference: Monzo and Revolut, which put a small card/source badge on the merchant icon. Close to flow Y's C, but a full circle instead of a 30×14 wordmark badge.",
