                      "id": "CJE3G",
                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Rows stay as they ship. Under each day header, a thin bar splits the day's total by Account in each bank's brand colour, with a legend of wordmark chips and amounts beneath it (largest first). The bank becomes a summary of the day you can read before the rows — useful to see which card carried the day. Light change to build: no row geometry moves. Reference: Monarch and Copilot's stacked spending bars, applied per day instead of per month.",
