                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Beside List · Month · Plan, an Accounts lens regroups the whole cycle by Account: one card per Account, sorted by spend, headed by a large wordmark chip (28pt — the logo at its most legible), the Account name, its cycle total and its share. Each card lists its latest three expenses; a \"See all ›\" (hidden here, every Account has one row in this sample) opens the list filtered to that Account. List stays as it ships, so daily logging is untouched; the bank gets its own home. Reference: Jenius and Jago Pockets, Money Lover's wallets.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
