                      "content": "The biggest logo (56×22 chip, letters ~11pt) and no name, so long Account names stop mattering. Catch: Danamon and Danamon CC become identical — any two Accounts on one bank do. Accounts without a logo still show symbol + name, so the column mixes two styles. Rows with a one-line meta grow 58 → 65pt.",
