                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The account rides on the category circle as a 20pt badge with a card-coloured ring — the pattern payment apps use for a payment method. Every account gets one: a logo, or its symbol on its pastel wash. The account's name leaves the meta line (VoiceOver still reads it), so the line is note · people again and long notes get the room. Unassigned: no badge. Catch: two Accounts at one bank (BCA Gaji, BCA Tabungan) wear the same badge and can no longer be told apart in the list.",
                      "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
