                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "Owner's proposal. The tag gets its own line above the category, as wide as the text column, so the name shows whole (an over-long one still truncates, “· Nov” never). The note has the full width again. Only tagged rows grow, by one tag height. The tag is read first — for a paid-early row that is the point: it does not count in this cycle's plan.",
