                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "Densest: no extra line, nothing squeezed, the prefix flows into the note like one sentence. But it drops the shapes — filled (Fixed), solid (Envelope), dashed (Paid early) — that tell the three kinds apart; only the glyph is left.",
